# Go build artifacts
*.exe
*.test
*.out

# Node artifacts — only ever pulled in ad hoc for headless DOM testing of fe/,
# never part of the build. The project has zero third-party dependencies and the
# UI is plain HTML served straight from disk.
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json

# Demo runtime state. Written by `cmd/demo -data <dir>`: one WAL and applied
# marker per (machine, shard) replica. Regenerated on every run and rewritten on
# every write, so committing it means a diff on every demo launch — and the
# contents are a snapshot of one throwaway session, not something anyone should
# restore from.
demo-data/
